Switch the below servers from pushing DR replication to its DR server to having the DR
server pull the data to itself.

1. Create the replacct on the production server.
2. Share the SSH key
3. Copy /etc/sudoers entry from DR to prod server
4. Comment out "Defaults    requiretty" if it exists in /etc/sudoers
5. Copy /etc/replicated_filesystems from prod to DR server
6. Move the cron job from the prod to DR server
7. Copy "pull" version of dr_replication script from GlobalShell to DR server
8. Do a test replication and resolve any issues.
